= No Elections in Wartime

The Chancellor's term has ended. But using the emergency powers the Senate granted him, he has announced that the election of a new Supreme Chancellor will be "deferred until the conclusion of hostilities". The Senate's protests are noted.

[? if not term_limits_protected : A Term Limits Amendment would have made this impossible. ?]
